sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor D as Donor
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant WC as WalletController
    participant WS as WalletService
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant RZP as Razorpay Gateway
    participant WH as PaymentWebhookService

    Note over D,RZP: Step 1 — Reserve the order (no money moves yet)

    D->>UI: Enter top-up amount, click Add Money
    UI->>WC: POST /api/wallet/topup/create-order
    WC->>WS: createTopUpOrder(email, amount)
    WS->>WS: Validate Rs.1 .. Rs.1,00,000
    WS->>DB: Upsert Wallet (findAndModify)
    WS->>DB: Insert WalletTransaction (PENDING)
    WS->>RZP: orders.create(amount, INR, receipt)
    RZP-->>WS: order_id
    WS->>DB: Store razorpayOrderId on row
    WS-->>UI: TopUpOrderResponse(orderId, amount, keyId)

    Note over D,RZP: Step 2 — Donor pays inside Razorpay Checkout

    UI->>RZP: Open Checkout popup with order_id
    D->>RZP: Choose UPI / Card and authorise
    RZP-->>UI: payment_id + signature

    Note over UI,DB: Step 3 — Verify, then credit exactly once

    UI->>WC: POST /api/wallet/topup/verify
    WC->>WS: verifyTopUp(email, request)
    WS->>DB: findByRazorpayOrderId
    DB-->>WS: WalletTransaction
    WS->>WS: Check ownership and status

    alt Signature invalid
        WS->>DB: Conditional update to FAILED
        WS-->>UI: 400 Payment could not be verified
    else Signature valid
        WS->>DB: findAndModify PENDING to COMPLETED
        alt Claim won
            DB-->>WS: Claimed row
            WS->>DB: inc balancePaise (atomic)
            WS->>DB: Stamp balanceAfterPaise
            WS-->>UI: Updated Wallet
            UI-->>D: New balance and passbook entry
        else Claim lost (already credited)
            DB-->>WS: null
            WS-->>UI: Existing Wallet (idempotent)
        end
    end

    Note over RZP,WH: Safety net — fires even if the browser never returned

    RZP->>WH: POST /api/payments/webhook (payment.captured)
    WH->>WH: Verify HMAC-SHA256 over raw body
    WH->>WS: completeTopUpFromWebhook(orderId, paymentId, amount)
    WS->>DB: Same conditional claim
    alt Row still PENDING
        WS->>DB: Credit balance
        WS-->>WH: true (credited)
    else Already settled by browser
        WS-->>WH: false (no-op)
    end
    WH-->>RZP: 200 OK
